# Copy to chrome.env to route the VPS Chromium's page traffic through a proxy.
# Loaded by jev-chrome.service; after editing: systemctl --user restart jev-chrome
#
# IPRoyal (recommended): whitelist this VPS's public IP in the IPRoyal dashboard
# (IP auth), pick a Spain sticky-session residential endpoint, and use host:port only.
# --proxy-server does not take inline user:pass, so IP-whitelist auth is the clean path.
#
# JEV_PROXY=geo.iproyal.com:12321
#
# Verify after restart, with the browser skill, that an IP page shows a Spain
# residential IP before trusting any results.
